  <item>
    <title>4. 愚人节：是谁骗了我，而我又骗了谁</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/66093c032d9eae5d0a24bffb</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">66093c032d9eae5d0a24bffb</guid>
    <pubDate>Sun, 31 Mar 2024 10:33:38 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>大家好，本期是和</span><a href="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/podcast/65a2712cea4c8167951dd184" data-url="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/podcast/65a2712cea4c8167951dd184"><span>易起拉识</span></a><span>主播饼哥的串台节目。</span></p><p><span>某天深夜，我们连麦分享了各自生活里的一些欺骗与谎言，有我们对他人的，也有他人对我们的，我们时常礼貌客套，也偶尔口是心非，仿佛在成年人的世界里，愚人节每天都过。希望你听得开心，同时也欢迎你的留言。</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="117">01:57</a> 身边离谱到失真的爆笑新闻；</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="385">06:25</a> 回忆愚人节，学生时代大家总能发明各式恶作剧；</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="597">09:57</a> 不再幼稚，成年后我们开始“谎话连篇”；</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1169">19:29</a> 力的作用是相互的，我们也时常感觉被骗；</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1462">24:22</a> 相差8岁的我们如何看待家人的报喜不报忧？</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1683">28:03</a> 比被骗感情更痛的是，我被骗钱了！</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2129">35:29</a> 另辟蹊径应对谎言：用魔法打败魔法；</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2450">40:50</a> 用好自我欺骗，就像「吸引力法则」；</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2689">44:49</a> 世界真是个巨型的草台班子！</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2853">47:33</a> 浅聊热衷于博眼球的黄色新闻和现代消费主义；</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3290">54:50</a> 我们一不小心就会低估了谣言的威力；</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3502">58:22</a> 其实，有时生活也需要谎言；</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3890">64:50</a> 在表演性社会里，真诚到底算必杀技还是自杀技？</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4177">69:37</a> 愚人节怀念哥哥张国荣——风继续吹，不忍远离</span></p><p><span>最后，祝我们</span><strong><span>易起</span></strong><span>在世界这个“大茅坑”里</span><strong><span>波澜不惊</span></strong><span>。</span></p><p><strong><span>封面设计：</span></strong><span>@饼哥</span></p><p><strong><span>BGM：</span></strong><span>当我迷失时听的歌 - 陈蕾；风继续吹 - 张国荣</span></p><p><span>你可以在小宇宙/苹果podcast/喜马拉雅/网易云收听本节目。</span></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/lq-i7OSsqY2p21xIY4HuCs-nCwiD.m4a" length="73832328" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>01:16:00</itunes:duration>
    <itunes:image href="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FqQzrRsc4G3jQuukAIXCxmcWqe7c.png"/>
    <itunes:episode>4</itunes:episode>
    <itunes:explicit>false</itunes:explicit>
  </item>
  <item>
    <title>3. 春暖花开，和港澳台来一场老派约会 | 串台【城市，声声不息】系列</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/65f2e4a1696bd9a87931e30a</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">65f2e4a1696bd9a87931e30a</guid>
    <pubDate>Thu, 14 Mar 2024 19:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Frvih4m9nbmkRL-T8p6DU-pvCBS4.png"></figure><span></span><p><span>听众朋友们大家好，欢迎收听新春播客串台企划</span><strong><span>【城市，声声不息】</span></strong><span>系列的第四站——一个既有点陌生又有点熟悉的地区——港澳台！</span></p><span></span><h2><strong><span>🌏列车长有话说</span></strong></h2><span></span><p><span>上期三位新一线城市的主播带着大家领略了位于祖国中部的</span><strong><span>重庆、成都</span></strong><span>的风光特色（上一站《新一线》导航：</span><a href="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/65e9e3b92d96b6aa806be3cf" data-url="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/65e9e3b92d96b6aa806be3cf"><span>EP06【特辑】| 巴适，自由，但网红？来巴蜀品尝新一线城市的热辣滚烫！</span></a><span>），本趟列车继续向南，本站停靠在了一个相对有点“特殊”的地方——港澳台地区。众所周知的历史原因，我们与这三地似乎一直在以一种不同于其他内陆城市的方式相处着，不管是在城市的宏观层面，还是个体的微观个性展现，“差异”是一个经常会被提及到的词汇。</span></p><span></span><p><span>本期三位长期生活在广东的主播——得益于物理距离上的亲缘关系时常往返港澳，也曾去过台湾旅行——将分享我们视角下对这三个地方的体验与感受。那么解开安全带，和我们一起下车走走吧！</span></p><span></span><p><span>🎙️Q老师：《</span><a href="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/podcast/64ad6bfce751898d04ed8ad6" data-url="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/podcast/64ad6bfce751898d04ed8ad6"><span>朋友走慢点</span></a><span>》主播，爱吃葡挞爱喝地下铁却不会粤语的广东珠海人。</span></p><span></span><p><span>🎙️小蒨：《</span><a href="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/podcast/641e7eb25010d7c9f1942236" data-url="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/podcast/641e7eb25010d7c9f1942236"><span>共商闲举</span></a><span>》主播，带着广普的广东广州人。</span></p><span></span><p><span>🎙️大许：《</span><a href="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/podcast/650fd460bbe351e616bc2873" data-url="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/podcast/650fd460bbe351e616bc2873"><span>茶熟欧</span></a><span>》《</span><a href="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/podcast/65e07208da891a9cd9a6f751" data-url="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/podcast/65e07208da891a9cd9a6f751"><span>波澜不JING</span></a><span>》主播，土生土长广东人，老家在汕头，现居深圳。</span></p><span></span><h2><strong><span>🌏本次列车导航</span></strong></h2><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="407">06:47</a> 集体的童年回忆——先进的香港TVB和甜到齁的台湾偶像剧！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="913">15:13</a> 忍不住感叹，画面无滤镜、原声台词、偶像派演员兼实力派歌手的年代已经一去不复返了；</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1229">20:29</a> 周处除三害观后感：台湾必吃榜榜首是阮经天；</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1379">22:59</a> “割裂”的香港：在赛博朋克的霓虹未来感与烟火缭绕的街市景象中来回横跳；</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1764">29:24</a> 菲佣——港澳文化一个不可或缺的符号；</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1994">33:14</a> 复合的澳门：博彩业打造繁华奢靡，老城半岛呈现本质纯真；</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2458">40:58</a> 治愈系台湾：悠闲漫步感受自由与平静，又嗲又软的台湾腔让人倍感温情；</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2792">46:32</a> 赴港澳方式推荐！巴士带你穿梭港珠澳大桥，感受震撼美丽！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3195">53:15</a> 走街串巷之后，我们来品品当地美食；</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3860">64:20</a> 非官方景点推荐，可以试试这样玩！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4278">71:18</a> 在深圳实地感受网络上被讨论得火热的港人北上；</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4756">79:16</a> 出行温馨小tips！</span></p><span></span><h2><strong><span>🌏一些城市风光与美食推荐</span></strong></h2><span></span><h2><strong><span>香港🇭🇰</span></strong></h2><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/lpGIHhG4TKbx4LuA4xWEQd5yoe7G.jpg"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FrX0EFjcOn-BBSO4-UUNyClnzFQ9.jpg"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FqM_Od5oH-bP1SBDke2rWRYOlcjO.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><strong><span>澳门🇲🇴</span></strong></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/lqdlBuv46ulsEvrJSsz9IE-ZJS4e.jpg"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/lvLXBC1Odcc6U0CI0Y8Sz3elRdQE.jpg"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fq3WVdsiBOcW02yO75PUk2FV5PBb.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><strong><span>台湾</span></strong></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FuCZGxqEiDgvpK73lFFA1xSCgd_1.jpg"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FlqIw4woK8HrM00JZdgxdMf4jqpe.jpg"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fj7vYpW4CbfDSNNfnqSj_mDHu-5z.jpg"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FqTqucnUM6FMgmZ3ulpyGzjiFOTJ.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span>最后，祝大家玩得开心！</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>【城市，声声不息】串台计划还将到访如下目的地，请收起小桌板，调整座椅靠背，跟着我们继续出发……</span></strong></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FtlNz8n9Sg2Y4OGZlvMYuUnZ_xPb.png"></figure><span></span><h5><span>🌏发起播客品牌</span></h5><span></span><p><a href="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/podcast/64ad6bfce751898d04ed8ad6" data-url="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/podcast/64ad6bfce751898d04ed8ad6"><span>《朋友走慢点》</span></a><a href="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/podcast/652276ede08de9fda5a66cb0" data-url="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/podcast/652276ede08de9fda5a66cb0"><span>《掰白百拜》</span></a><a href="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/podcast/65596866af867a0d91acaad9" data-url="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/podcast/65596866af867a0d91acaad9"><span>《奇思妙谈》</span></a><a href="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/podcast/61dbfe39a8b6eb27b6082596" data-url="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/podcast/61dbfe39a8b6eb27b6082596"><span>《杏子鸡尾酒》</span></a><a href="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/podcast/641e7eb25010d7c9f1942236" data-url="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/podcast/641e7eb25010d7c9f1942236"><span>《共商闲举》</span></a><a href="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/podcast/65445e7488103669c58a6beb" data-url="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/podcast/65445e7488103669c58a6beb"><span>《心理共鸣》</span></a><a href="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/podcast/63b53f37a7b161b6b921c84d" data-url="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/podcast/63b53f37a7b161b6b921c84d"><span>《漫游者说》</span></a><a href="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/podcast/65d8a3870bef6c20743f5dfb" data-url="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/podcast/65d8a3870bef6c20743f5dfb"><span>《JINGYI RADIO》</span></a><a href="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/podcast/628b19c16c7eec4d0113c7eb" data-url="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/podcast/628b19c16c7eec4d0113c7eb"><span>《脑力有限》</span></a></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fj6ppkUAOp7z7o9Q0j4YYOtLPb38.png"></figure><span></span><h2><strong><span>🌏制作团队</span></strong></h2><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FvhmtQ_2fD6Bwf2cMHHz8TnF0c07.png"></figure><span></span><h2><br></h2>]]></description>
